BT /F2 14 Tf 50 751 Td (Architecture Description) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 713 Td (Spell data is loaded from `Assets/Resources/spells.json` into `SpellDefinition` objects.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 700 Td (`SpellBuilder` separates base spells from modifier spells, builds the player's starting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 687 Td (Arcane Bolt, and generates random reward spells by combining one base spell with a random) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 674 Td (list of modifier definitions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 652 Td (`Spell` is a data-driven runtime spell rather than a MonoBehaviour. When cast, it builds a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 639 Td (`SpellCastProfile` from the base definition, evaluates RPN expressions with the current) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 626 Td (`wave` and player `power`, then applies each modifier in order. The profile controls damage,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 613 Td (mana cost, cooldown, projectile speed, projectile trajectory, repeated casts, split volleys,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 600 Td (secondary projectiles, and custom on-hit projectiles.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 578 Td (The player now owns a `SpellCaster` with up to four spell slots. `SpellUIContainer` keeps) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 565 Td (the four slot UIs visible and synchronized with the inventory, while `SpellUI` shows each) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 552 Td (slot's icon, mana cost, damage, cooldown, highlight state, and drop button. The reward) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 539 Td (screen stores a pending reward in `GameManager`, previews its stats, and shows the slot) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 526 Td (where the reward will be equipped or the spell it will replace. `EnemySpawner.NextWave`) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 513 Td (accepts the pending reward before starting the next wave.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 491 Td (Player progression is loaded from `classes.json`. `PlayerController.ApplyWaveStats`) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 478 Td (evaluates the mage class expressions for HP, mana, mana regeneration, spell power, and speed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 465 Td (each wave, preserving current HP and mana percentages when the maximum values change.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 50 443 Td (New Spells) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 405 Td (- `damage_amp`: increases spell damage and mana cost multiplicatively.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 392 Td (- `speed_amp`: increases projectile speed multiplicatively.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 379 Td (- `doubler`: casts the modified spell a second time after a short delay, with higher mana) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 366 Td (  cost and cooldown.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 353 Td (- `splitter`: casts the modified spell in two nearby directions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 340 Td (- `chaos`: increases damage and changes the projectile trajectory to spiraling.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 327 Td (- `homing`: changes the projectile trajectory to homing while reducing damage and adding) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 314 Td (  mana cost.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 301 Td (- `mana_stream`: an added modifier that lowers mana cost with a small cooldown penalty.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 288 Td (- `overclocked`: an added modifier that reduces cooldown and increases projectile speed,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 275 Td (  but costs more mana.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 262 Td (- `nova_burst`: an added behavior modifier that releases extra arcane shards from the hit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 249 Td (  point.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 227 Td (Optional base spells from the assignment are also supported: Magic Missile uses homing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 214 Td (projectiles, Arcane Spray creates a cone of short-lived bolts, and Arcane Blast creates) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 201 Td (secondary projectiles when it hits.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 50 179 Td (Contributions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 141 Td (Todd Crandell implemented the JSON-driven spell definition pipeline, modifier evaluation,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 128 Td (reward generation, player stat scaling, and the final reward-slot/drop polish. The main) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 115 Td (lesson was how much cleaner spell behavior becomes when the cast path builds a temporary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 102 Td (profile from data instead of baking every variation into separate classes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 80 Td (ValerieVATS expanded the player spell system from a single spell into multiple spell slots) Tj ET
